{"id":"n48362-2-8","stage":2,"title":"대리 · 代理","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48362-2-8-1","ko":"김 대리가 이번 사업 제안서를 써 보도록 하세요.","zh":"请让金代理来撰写这份项目提案书。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"대리가","meaning":"代理","explanation":"대리：代理；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"대리","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48362","senseId":"2","lemma":"대리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사업","meaning":"事业，生意","explanation":"사업：事业，生意","readings":[{"term":"사업","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62048","senseId":"1","lemma":"사업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제안서를","meaning":"建议书","explanation":"제안서：建议书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"제안서","audio":"/audio/74c99c4a1a4638eb4601.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75716","senseId":"1","lemma":"제안서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"써","meaning":"写","explanation":"쓰다：写；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보도록","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；도록：表示目的、达到的程度或促使某事发生。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하세요.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4e96b696526850f7","term":"대리","zh":"代理","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3","entryId":"48362","definition":"公司中一般职员与课长之间的职位；或位居该职位的人。","pronunciation":["대ː리"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"7b3733aab2fd0dcf","term":"사업","zh":"事业，生意","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3","entryId":"62048","definition":"为取得经济利益而经营某种组织。","pronunciation":["사ː업"]},{"id":"74c99c4a1a4638eb","term":"제안서","zh":"建议书","audio":"/audio/74c99c4a1a4638eb4601.mp3","entryId":"75716","definition":"把意见或提案书写成文的一种文稿。","pronunciation":["제안서"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"用铅笔或其它笔等书写工具在纸张等上划线而书写一定的字。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6441cf875ba3ff3bc56b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48362-2-8-2","ko":"알겠습니다, 부장님.","zh":"明白，部长。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"알겠습니다,","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부장님.","meaning":"部长","explanation":"부장：部长；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"부장","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59737","senseId":"1","lemma":"부장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3",